# Benefits Carousel & Mobile CTA

The user wants to continue the mobile optimization trend.
1.  **Benefits Section**: Transform the grid into a swipeable carousel on mobile.
2.  **Header CTA**: Ensure the "Solicitar Asesoría" button is present on the main mobile header, not just inside the hamburger menu.

